  qa:location "crates/sc-runtime/tests/observability_contract.rs:80" ;
  qa:issue "The promised types-only dependency enforcement does not inspect resolved package identities, leaving full logger and OTLP dependencies undetected through aliases or transitive edges." ;
  qa:remedy "Add one shared resolved-normal-dependency check for sc-runtime and sc-cron to the existing test/CI path. Reject sc-observability, sc-observability-otlp, and sc-observability-dev-adapter by actual package identity anywhere reachable, while permitting the authorized types facade. Reuse that check for both libraries and make the boundary-manifest enforcement comment accurate." ;
